From 0e38b055ac22c713fc402ea3bdb676a7ce8fe561 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Correa da Silva Sanches <juca@members.fsf.org>
Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 02:41:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/9] sharc drc: complete MODE1 ALUSAT across the whole
 fixed-point ALU family

Extends the ADD/SUB ALUSAT fix to every fixed-point ALU form the DRC emits:
ADDC/SUBB (0x05/0x06), NEG (0x22), the carry-in forms (0x25/0x26), INC/DEC
(0x29/0x2a) and the dual add/sub (0x78-0x7F), via a shared
generate_fixed_alusat_tail() helper (capture COND_V while flags are live,
clamp to 0x7FFFFFFF/0x80000000 per TRM B-6, fix AN/AZ for the saturated
value). The interpreter already saturates all of these; this restores
DRC == interpreter across the family.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/devices/cpu/sharc/sharc.h      |  1 +
 src/devices/cpu/sharc/sharcdrc.cpp | 97 +++++++++++++++++++++---------
 2 files changed, 69 insertions(+), 29 deletions(-)

